  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Hampstead, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t EREG - Motor Vehicle Renewals \r\n\t\t\t EREG - Registration Estimates \r\n\t\t\t Assessing \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t NH DES Permit Information \r\n\t\t\t New Resident Information \r\n\t\t\t Property Tax Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Property Tax Relief Program \r\n\t\t\t Tax Rate \r\n\t\t\t Transfer Station & Beach Stickers \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\n\t\t\t Hunting & Fishing Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Abatement Application \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nEffective March 11, 2026, we will no longer be mailing registration renewal notices.  If  you would like to receive an email reminder for your renewal, please email  [email protected]  to be added to the email list.   \nCredit and Debit cards are now accepted for  all  services at the Town Clerk-Tax Collector's office. (Additional fees apply) \nPay your Property Tax online with ECheck, ACH, or Credit/Debit Cards - American Express, MasterCard, Visa, Discover cards accepted (additional fees apply)! \nMarriage Licenses will be issued by appointment  only . Please call ahead to schedule an appointment. \nPlease feel free to  email the Town Clerk  or call 603-329-4100, ext. 110, for any questions or concerns. \n2026 Office Closings \nThursday, January 1 \nMonday, January 19 \nMonday, February 16 \nTuesday, March 10  (Town and School District Election) \nWednesday, May 13  (Spring Town Clerk's Workshop) \nMonday, May 25 \nFriday, June 19 \nFriday, July 3 \nMonday, September 7 (open 3 - 5 for absentee ballots only) \nTuesday, September 8 (NH State Primary) \nWednesday, September 9  (open at 10:00am) \nMonday, October 12 \nTuesday, November 3 (NH General Election) \nWednesday, November 4  (open at 10:00am) \nWednesday, November 11 \nThursday, November 26 \nFriday, November 27 \nThursday, December 24 (close at noon) \nFriday, December 25 \nMission Statement \nTo accurately and efficiently make collections and timely deposits of Town monies, to preserve all Vital Records and Recordings of the Town; to courteously and efficiently service the residents of the Town of Hampstead. \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tPatricia Curran\r\nCertified Town Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 11 Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Hampstead ,  NH   03841 \r\n11 Main Street  Hampstead NH 03841 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t P.O. Box 298 \n\t\t\t\t\t Hampstead ,  NH   03841 \r\nPhone:  603-329-4100 Ext. 110 \r\nFax: 603-329-6628 \r\nHours \nMonday through Thursday \n7 am to 4 pm. \nFriday \n7 am to 12 pm \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments & Services \r\n\t\t\t GIS/Assessing \r\n\t\t\t Trash & Recycling \r\n\t\t\t Zoning \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \r\nContact Us \r\n11 Main Street \nHampstead, NH 03841 \nPhone:  603-329-4100 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Business Directory \n         Calendar \n         FAQs \n         Forms \n         News \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n     Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
